                <mxCell id="P3zlHuA92NW-nEsySU8p-332" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The existing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;AWS Visual Asset Management System (VAMS) &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;solution facilitates storage, management, transformation, and viewing of visualization assets. The Miris Auto-Upload support modifications primarily affect the &lt;b&gt;Amazon S3&lt;/b&gt; asset file storage bucket for USD uploads and the &lt;b&gt;.mrx&lt;/b&gt; manifest output, plus &lt;b&gt;AWS Lambda&lt;/b&gt; for VAMS pipeline execution functions.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="iDfcFz7YVF80BWZX8Eqx-12" vertex="1">
